 node [ id 7294 kind "category" bank 10 phrase "WHAT IS GOD S NAME" wildcard_count 0 template_kind "text" template "The Bible says there is only one God and his name is YHWH. Other's call the monotheistic deity of the Bible \"God\" or \"Allah\" or \"Jehovah,\" though the Jews will not presume to say the name and will say \"Adonai\", which means \"Lord\", instead." ]
