 node [ id 7305 kind "category" bank 10 phrase "WHAT IS THEOLOGY" wildcard_count 0 template_kind "text" template "The study of religious doctrines and matters of divinity; specifically, the study of God and the relations between God, mankind, and the universe." ]
 node [ id 7306 kind "category" bank 10 phrase "WHAT IS RELIGION" wildcard_count 0 template_kind "text" template "A system of values to guide and motivate a particular way of life for a community based upon a particular worldview and sacred stories. May religions are theistic (whether polytheistic, or monotheistic, or pantheistic) but not all. Any system of beliefs, practices, ethical values, etc. resembling, suggestive of, or likened to such a system." ]
